  "_doc": "Item-9 XI selection (docs/item9_xi_selection.md). Maps each data source's raw position vocabulary onto our canonical positions-table codes + the role taxonomy used for the >20% minutes-share eligibility test. role = folded family (the eligibility level); code = fine canonical code (the slot-matching level); flank = C/L/R; cb_lean = StatsBomb-only L/R centre-back side, feeds the RCB/LCB split. Authored S42 against the FULL observed vocab of player_match_all (understat/fbref) and statsbomb_event. Validate with validate_position_map.py before use.",
